                <note rend="inline" type="source">893.512/871: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Minister in China</hi>
                        (<hi rendition="#italic">MacMurray</hi>)</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1928-11-08T19:00:00-05:00"><hi rendition="#italic">November 8,
                                1928—7 p.m.</hi></date></dateline></opener>
                <p>373. Your 817, November 7, 9 p.m. Department understands the case. Your
                    instructions to Jenkins are approved.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Kellogg</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
